  "application_type_full": "Householder planning permission",
  "description": "The proposal seeks planning permission for the construction of a\nsingle-storey rear extension to the existing dwelling. The extension will\nreplace a previous outrigger and infill arrangement with a contemporary,\nfull-width addition at ground floor level.\n\nThe proposed extension is designed to be subordinate in scale to the\nhost property and consistent with the prevailing rear building line along\nthe terrace. It is articulated in two parts: a main rear volume with a\npitched gable roof featuring conservation-style roof-lights, and a flat-\nroofed secondary element within the side return.\n\nAs part of the proposal, it is also intended to replace\nthe existing black-painted garage door to the front of\nthe property with a new white-painted timber screen.\nThe new frontage will incorporate insulated timber\npanelling, a single entrance door, and sections of\nobscured glazing to maintain privacy while allowing\nnatural light into the internal space. The white finish\nhas been selected to complement and be sympathetic\nto the existing white rendered banding and architec-\ntural detailing around the front windows and entrance\nof the property, contributing to a more coherent and\nrefined street-facing elevation.",
